### 3. PR Review with Security + RBAC + Stripe + NextAuth

Use this template for thorough PR reviews:

```markdown
## PR Review Checklist

### Security Review
- [ ] **Input Validation**: All user inputs validated with Zod
- [ ] **SQL Injection**: Using Prisma parameterized queries
- [ ] **XSS Prevention**: Output properly encoded
- [ ] **CSRF**: Tokens verified for mutations
- [ ] **Secrets**: No hardcoded credentials

### RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)
- [ ] **Middleware**: Protected routes use auth middleware
- [ ] **Role Checks**: `session.user.role` verified before actions
- [ ] **Listing Ownership**: Users can only modify their own listings
- [ ] **Admin Routes**: Admin-only routes properly protected

### Stripe Integration
- [ ] **Webhook Verification**: Signatures validated
- [ ] **Idempotency**: Duplicate events handled gracefully
- [ ] **Error Handling**: Payment failures show user-friendly messages
- [ ] **Subscription State**: Plan limits enforced correctly
- [ ] **Test Mode**: Test keys used in development

### NextAuth
- [ ] **Session Handling**: Sessions checked before protected actions
- [ ] **Callback URLs**: Validated and whitelisted
- [ ] **Token Refresh**: Long sessions handled properly
- [ ] **Logout**: Sessions properly invalidated

### General Quality
- [ ] **Types**: No `any` types without justification
- [ ] **Tests**: New code has test coverage
- [ ] **Documentation**: Complex logic is documented
- [ ] **Performance**: No obvious N+1 queries or memory leaks
```

